petroglyphs and pictographs on state, school and
institutional land in Wyoming. No survey conducted pursuant
to this section shall access private lands without first
receiving permission from the landowner.
Section 3. This act is effective immediately upon
completion of all acts necessary for a bill to become law
as provided by Article 4, Section 8 of the Wyoming
Constitution.
